{%- comment -%}
  LEXE repeat-order credit: plain rules line for the cart.
  Hidden while Theme settings > LEXE checkout > "Lock purchasing to Notify me" is ON,
  and also hidden until "Show repeat-order credit rules" is ON. Display only: no prices, no logic.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if settings.lexe_lock_notify == false and settings.lexe_credit_show -%}
  <div class="lexe-credit-rules cart-primary-typography" style="margin-top:12px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:rgba(0,0,0,.7)">
    <p style="margin:0 0 4px;font-weight:600">Repeat-order credit</p>
    <p style="margin:0">
      Orders with $45 or more in products earn a one-time code for your next order, worth {{ settings.lexe_credit_value | default: '$4' }} off.
      We email it after your order is delivered and the return window has closed.
    </p>
    <p style="margin:4px 0 0">
      Rules: one code per order, for your account only. Works on $40 or more in products (shipping not counted).
      Can't be combined with any other code or the free Specs offer. Valid for 60 days from the day we send it. No cash value.
      If the original order is refunded, the code is cancelled.
    </p>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
